For each event, if the operation is enter, I record the time only if the car is not already a key. If the operation is exit, I clear the car from the parked dictionary and apply the rate if it was parked; once recorded, that fee is also cleared from the parked dictionary. Car and time tuples from the input are not saved at the end, so they carry no stored fields.

